Package: vabaxos-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: apt
Description: VabaxOS archive key and APT sources
 The public key of the VabaxOS project and the APT sources of the VabaxOS
 archive (ADR-0026), so the vabaxos-* packages receive their updates. The
 key is valid only for the VabaxOS archive (Signed-By).
